OL,3,GNEWSADisability cricket team wins
OL,4,Anational title
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cricket team has been crowned
OL,7,Fnational disability champions for the
OL,8,Ffirst time.
OL,10,FCornwall Super 9s disability team from
OL,11,FTruro became South West champions for
OL,12,Fthe second successive season, in only
OL,13,Fits third competitive campaign, which
OL,14,Fqualified them for the national finals.
OL,16,FThey beat the Isle of White in the semi
OL,17,Ffinals, before going on to beat
OL,18,FMiddlesex in the final in
OL,19,FKidderminster, Worcestershire on
OL,20,FSunday, where they scored 176/8 from
OL,21,Ftheir 30 overs before bowling their
OL,22,Fopponents out for 79 runs.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
